    {
      "id": "fourier-cosine-basis-theorem",
      "type": "theorem",
      "regions": [
        [
          198,
          80,
          805,
          955,
          875
        ]
      ],
      "en": "Let $\\phi_0(x)=1$, $\\phi_n(x)=\\sqrt2\\cos(n\\pi x)$, $n\\in\\mathbb{N}$. Then the functions $\\phi_n$, $n=0,1,2,\\ldots$, form a basis of $L^2(0,1)$.",
      "zh": "设 $\\phi_0(x)=1$, $\\phi_n(x)=\\sqrt2\\cos(n\\pi x)$, $n\\in\\mathbb{N}$. 那么函数 $\\phi_n$, $n=0,1,2,\\ldots$, 构成 $L^2(0,1)$ 的一组基.",
      "label": "thm:fourier-cosine-hilbert-basis",
      "render_role": "theorem",
      "source_locations": [
        {
          "pdf_page": 198,
          "printed_page": 188,
          "bbox": [
            31.980547112462006,
            321.837271004422,
            381.7677811550152,
            349.82312065698045
          ],
          "bbox_precision": "visually selected parent block, top-left PDF points",
          "crop": "workspace/crops/chapter-06-batch-10/fourier-cosine-basis-theorem-198.png",
          "raw_ocr": "workspace/raw-text/pdf-0198.txt"
        }
      ],
      "formula_ids": [
        "math:fourier-cosine-basis-theorem:001",
        "math:fourier-cosine-basis-theorem:002",
        "math:fourier-cosine-basis-theorem:003",
        "math:fourier-cosine-basis-theorem:004",
