    {
      "id": "fourier-cosine-basis-proof",
      "type": "proof",
      "regions": [
        [
          198,
          80,
          885,
          955,
          1230
        ]
      ],
      "en": "An easy calculation shows that the $\\phi_n$ are an orthonormal system. By Theorem~\\ref{thm:hilbert-basis-equivalent-characterizations} it therefore suffices to show that the linear span of the $\\phi_n$ is dense in $L^2(0,1)$. Since $C([0,1])$ is dense in $L^2(0,1)$, we only need to show that every continuous function can be approximated by a linear combination of the $\\phi_n$. We make the substitution $\\cos\\pi x=u$, which bijectively maps $[0,1]$ to $[-1,1]$. By the Weierstrass approximation theorem, every continuous function on $[-1,1]$ can be approximated uniformly by polynomials; hence every continuous function on $[0,1]$ can be approximated uniformly by polynomials in $\\cos\\pi x$. Elementary trigonometric identities show that any expression $\\sum_{n=0}^N a_n(\\cos\\pi x)^n$ can be rewritten in the form $\\sum_{n=0}^N b_n\\cos(n\\pi x)$.",
      "zh": "简单计算表明 $\\phi_n$ 为标准正交系. 因而由 Theorem~\\ref{thm:hilbert-basis-equivalent-characterizations}, 只需证明 $\\phi_n$ 的线性张成空间在 $L^2(0,1)$ 中稠密. 由于 $C([0,1])$ 在 $L^2(0,1)$ 中稠密, 只需证明每个连续函数均可由 $\\phi_n$ 的线性组合逼近. 作代换 $\\cos\\pi x=u$, 它将 $[0,1]$ 双射到 $[-1,1]$. 由 Weierstrass 逼近定理, $[-1,1]$ 上的每个连续函数都可由多项式一致逼近; 因而 $[0,1]$ 上的每个连续函数都可由 $\\cos\\pi x$ 的多项式一致逼近. 初等三角恒等式表明, 任意表达式 $\\sum_{n=0}^N a_n(\\cos\\pi x)^n$ 都可改写成 $\\sum_{n=0}^N b_n\\cos(n\\pi x)$ 的形式.",
      "label": null,
      "render_role": "proof",
      "source_locations": [
