    {
      "id": "fourier-sine-basis-theorem",
      "type": "theorem",
      "regions": [
        [
          198,
          80,
          1315,
          955,
          1385
        ]
      ],
      "en": "Let $\\psi_n(x)=\\sqrt2\\sin(n\\pi x)$, $n\\in\\mathbb{N}$. Then the functions $\\psi_n$, $n\\in\\mathbb{N}$, form a basis of $L^2(0,1)$.",
      "zh": "设 $\\psi_n(x)=\\sqrt2\\sin(n\\pi x)$, $n\\in\\mathbb{N}$. 那么函数 $\\psi_n$, $n\\in\\mathbb{N}$, 构成 $L^2(0,1)$ 的一组基.",
      "label": "thm:fourier-sine-hilbert-basis",
      "render_role": "theorem",
      "source_locations": [
        {
          "pdf_page": 198,
          "printed_page": 188,
          "bbox": [
            31.980547112462006,
            525.7341756159192,
            381.7677811550152,
